WEBVTT

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.940
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:34.180
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:39.020
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:43.520
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:46.890
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.890 --> 00:00:51.460
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.730 --> 00:00:56.500
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:59.170
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:01.370
Give thanks!

00:01:01.370 --> 00:01:04.580
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:10.380
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.380 --> 00:01:15.520
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:20.790
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:24.960
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:31.040
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.840
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:36.410
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.410 --> 00:01:39.010
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.010 --> 00:01:43.280
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:49.820
Someone once said:

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:55.030
There are scallops soaked in 
plenty of natural, rich butter...

00:01:55.030 --> 00:01:58.000
Butter Bivalves!

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:02.030
There's a mountain pass 
made of fine, sweet,

00:02:02.030 --> 00:02:05.570
vanilla, strawberry, and melon gelato...

00:02:05.570 --> 00:02:09.310
Gelato Ridge!

00:02:09.670 --> 00:02:12.880
The world is in the Gourmet Age...

00:02:12.880 --> 00:02:17.620
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:19.120 --> 00:02:22.790
Ever since the day Hotel Gourmet's Chef 
Komatsu hired Gourmet Hunter Toriko

00:02:22.790 --> 00:02:26.360
to capture an ingredient, 
the two have gone on

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:29.960
a number of dangerous journeys 
together in order to track down

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:34.370
various ingredients, and at last 
officially became partners.

00:02:35.970 --> 00:02:40.470
Soon after, Toriko took the plunge 
into the Gourmet World alone

00:02:40.470 --> 00:02:44.840
in order to test himself, but 
the environment was so harsh

00:02:44.840 --> 00:02:46.840
that his life was in danger.

00:02:47.780 --> 00:02:54.520
His life was saved by Knocking Master 
Jiro, though, at the request of Komatsu.

00:02:55.620 --> 00:03:00.490
This drove home to Toriko the 
preciousness of his partner, Komatsu.

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:09.170
Shock! The Broken Kitchen 
Knife and Cutler Melk!

00:03:26.950 --> 00:03:28.820
Piping hot Strawberrice!

00:03:28.820 --> 00:03:30.360
It looks delicious!

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:35.460
Thank goodness you're safe, Toriko-san!

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:37.930
Komatsu, you're gonna 
drip snot in there!

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:40.830
Thank goodness you made 
it back in one piece!

00:03:40.830 --> 00:03:44.670
Stop crying! You're gonna 
ruin the Strawberrice!

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:46.970
I can't help it, I'm so happy...

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:49.070
Okay, I get it! Quit crying!

00:03:49.070 --> 00:03:50.340
Alright...

00:03:50.340 --> 00:03:51.680
Is that...?

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:54.980
Yes... Cow with a kick...

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:57.420
Spiced Beefsteak...

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:01.290
Thank you for the food!

00:04:04.690 --> 00:04:06.160
Yummy!

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:09.030
Tender meat that melts in your mouth

00:04:09.030 --> 00:04:11.660
made even more stimulating with 
several kinds of spices...

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:13.560
I can't begin to describe the flavor!

00:04:13.560 --> 00:04:15.430
I grilled this up, too!

00:04:15.970 --> 00:04:18.000
Corn on the Bone!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:20.140
What a savory aroma!

00:04:22.510 --> 00:04:26.480
Cornlike sweetness is overflowing 
from the meaty kernels!

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:32.520
It makes me so happy to see you eating 
my cooking again, Toriko-san...

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:34.720
What, are you crying again?

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:37.990
I was really worried about you!

00:04:37.990 --> 00:04:42.030
Even though President Ichiryu told 
you that you wouldn't survive

00:04:42.030 --> 00:04:45.630
in the Gourmet World until you 
finished special training...

00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:49.030
...you suddenly went off on your own!

00:04:49.030 --> 00:04:51.670
I was curious about what 
kind of place it was...

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:55.910
But how did you even know I 
went to the Gourmet World?

00:04:56.670 --> 00:05:00.980
Oh... Sunny-san told me about it.

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:04.150
He said even your life 
might be in danger there,

00:05:04.450 --> 00:05:07.620
so he gave me Jiro-san's 
contact information.

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:09.790
Figures it was Sunny...

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:14.460
Well... True enough, the Gourmet 
World was a hell of a place...

00:05:14.860 --> 00:05:17.730
Still, that bastard Sunny...

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:21.270
He lied to me, claimed the 
Gourmet World was no big deal!

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:24.070
Sunny-san was worried about you, too.

00:05:24.070 --> 00:05:29.740
That's why he told me you were heading 
for the Gourmet World, Toriko-san.

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:33.580
Since he's the one who told me 
how to get to the Gourmet World,

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:38.850
I'm sure he thought it was 
"unbeautiful" to be the one to call in the cavalry.

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:42.190
I see... That's why he came to me...

00:05:42.190 --> 00:05:46.460
Oh, well, in any case, the important 
thing is you made it back!

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:50.030
There it is! Strawberrice!

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:54.200
Each grain of the rice is 
like a little strawberry!

00:05:57.600 --> 00:06:01.040
It's got just the right amount 
of sourness, like vinegared rice!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:02.140
And the more you bite into it,

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:03.940
the more the sweetness of 
the strawberry comes out!

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:06.310
This rice is like a dessert!

00:06:06.310 --> 00:06:07.680
Delicious!

00:06:07.680 --> 00:06:11.150
Anyway, to celebrate 
your safe homecoming,

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:14.320
I'm cooking my best dishes 
for you, Toriko-san!

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:17.590
That's...

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:19.860
Roast Banana!

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:21.360
One of my favorites!

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:24.460
I'll put some Caramel Caviar on top.

00:06:31.700 --> 00:06:33.840
Delicious!

00:06:33.840 --> 00:06:37.110
The Century Soup is almost ready!

00:06:38.310 --> 00:06:43.480
Every dish is delightful, 
delectable, and divine!

00:06:44.850 --> 00:06:47.550
I'm glad we became partners.

00:06:48.520 --> 00:06:50.590
Um... Toriko-san...

00:06:51.020 --> 00:06:54.960
How did the ingredients in 
the Gourmet World taste?

00:07:02.700 --> 00:07:05.670
I didn't eat anything 
in the Gourmet World.

00:07:05.970 --> 00:07:07.540
Really?!

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:08.470
Yeah.

00:07:09.440 --> 00:07:11.310
Look, Toriko-kun...

00:07:11.310 --> 00:07:14.280
Ham Shells. Rare, right?

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:18.280
Not every day you can eat an 
ingredient in the Gourmet World...

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:21.720
Thanks, but I'll pass.

00:07:23.990 --> 00:07:25.220
I get it...

00:07:25.490 --> 00:07:27.360
W-Why?

00:07:27.360 --> 00:07:30.160
You're more of a glutton 
than anyone, Toriko-san,

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:32.330
so why didn't you eat anything there?

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:34.530
I thought I'd wait 'til 
I could eat with you.

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:40.470
Sorry. I went into the Gourmet World 
alone, making you worry about me.

00:07:40.470 --> 00:07:43.370
Oh, no! You have nothing 
to apologize for!

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:49.380
The Gourmet World is a more 
complicated, profound land than I thought.

00:07:49.710 --> 00:07:52.750
It would be difficult to 
understand everything there

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.490
and conquer it with my strength alone.

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:59.420
Komatsu... I need your power.

00:07:59.420 --> 00:08:01.190
Toriko-san...

00:08:01.190 --> 00:08:02.960
As for the Gourmet World's food...

00:08:03.230 --> 00:08:08.530
Komatsu, let's join 
forces and eat together!

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:17.880
Okay, Toriko-san!

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:21.510
Alright!

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:23.780
I've still got more to make today!

00:08:23.780 --> 00:08:25.680
Yeah! Do it up, Komatsu!

00:08:26.080 --> 00:08:28.290
It won't take long!

00:08:28.990 --> 00:08:31.090
Please wait a little bit!

00:08:33.060 --> 00:08:35.660
Maybe you're a little <i>too</i> enthusiastic?

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:03.520
Th-The knife...

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:06.520
My knife...!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:09.160
Komatsu... Isn't that a Don Acorn?!

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:13.100
Its shell is so hard that it takes 
a special hammer to crack open!

00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:16.870
S-Stupid mistake... Even though 
it was my prized knife...

00:09:16.870 --> 00:09:20.300
Maybe it was worn out from 
being used for so many years...

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:22.940
Either way, it's broken and there's 
nothing you can do about it.

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:24.740
You'll just have to buy a new one.

00:09:24.740 --> 00:09:29.310
Th-This knife wasn't 
expensive or anything...

00:09:29.310 --> 00:09:33.520
...but it was the first knife I 
ever bought with my own money,

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:35.820
saved up while I was in training.

00:09:35.820 --> 00:09:39.860
I can't count the number of ingredients 
this has chopped over the years.

00:09:39.860 --> 00:09:43.330
This knife helped me grow.

00:09:43.660 --> 00:09:47.130
I am where I am now 
thanks to this knife.

00:09:48.030 --> 00:09:50.070
There are too many memories...

00:09:50.540 --> 00:09:51.900
Thank you...

00:09:51.900 --> 00:09:54.670
You've worked so hard for me...

00:09:54.670 --> 00:09:57.510
You've always been there 
for me when I needed you...

00:09:57.510 --> 00:10:01.350
Komatsu's sincere heart when it 
comes to objects may be the source

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:06.080
of his ability to hear the 
voices of ingredients...

00:10:06.620 --> 00:10:08.790
Thank you so much...

00:10:08.790 --> 00:10:09.950
A knife, eh?

00:10:11.560 --> 00:10:12.890
That's right!

00:10:13.320 --> 00:10:14.830
Certainly, in here...

00:10:15.360 --> 00:10:16.460
That's...

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:20.100
The list of ingredients the 
old man asked me to capture...

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:23.970
There was a name in here 
that got my attention.

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:26.540
Melk Stardust!

00:10:27.340 --> 00:10:32.480
Could that refer to Cutler Melk, 
whose knives every chef dreams of?!

00:10:32.480 --> 00:10:36.380
I've never heard of this ingredient 
called Melk Stardust myself,

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:38.480
but if there is a connection 
to Cutler Melk,

00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:41.450
then maybe he knows something about it.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:45.290
Apparently, Melk lives on 
the rocky Melk Mountain,

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:47.560
which people stay away from...

00:10:48.230 --> 00:10:51.460
What do you think, Komatsu? While 
we search for Melk Stardust,

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:55.030
maybe you can have Melk 
make you a new knife.

00:10:55.030 --> 00:10:56.830
R-Really?!

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:00.440
I'm all for it!

00:11:00.440 --> 00:11:03.170
I'll get to meet Cutler Melk!

00:11:03.910 --> 00:11:06.940
Oh. I'll bring you back a souvenir,

00:11:06.940 --> 00:11:09.210
so don't get into any 
trouble while I'm gone.

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:12.950
Yeesh. And you were sobbing up a 
storm just a few minutes ago...

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:17.190
I'm thrilled that our first trip 
together after becoming partners

00:11:17.190 --> 00:11:19.190
is one where I get a new knife!

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:22.860
Well, searching for the ingredient 
is the main thing for me...

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.000
But this Melk Stardust...

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.970
I have a feeling it won't be 
so easy to get our hands on...

00:11:41.050 --> 00:11:43.680
Hmm... What the hell is he doing?

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.550
Damn that Toriko!

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:47.790
Hey! I'm here!

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:49.720
You're late, Yosaku!

00:11:49.720 --> 00:11:51.220
How long were you going 
to make me wait?!

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:53.760
Rules are made to be broken!

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:57.400
But I kept my promise 
to come here, didn't I?

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:59.560
Again, I have no idea what 
you're talking about!

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:03.030
So... what about Toriko?

00:12:03.530 --> 00:12:06.340
According to a report 
from checkpoint 18,

00:12:06.340 --> 00:12:09.640
Toriko entered the Gourmet World 
without any special training.

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:11.610
How reckless can he be?

00:12:11.610 --> 00:12:14.350
Toriko knows about 
breaking rules, too...

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:18.180
I'm sure he couldn't just sit around 
and do nothing after hearing that

00:12:18.180 --> 00:12:20.690
GOD is going to appear in 
the Gourmet World soon.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:24.960
GOD, the summit of all this 
world's ingredients...

00:12:25.560 --> 00:12:31.060
It seems Toriko means to put GOD 
on his Full Course of Life Menu.

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:36.030
And making matters worse, the 
Gourmet Corp. is after GOD, too.

00:12:36.400 --> 00:12:40.170
Besides, all my efforts to stop 
Sunny were for nothing, too.

00:12:40.170 --> 00:12:42.940
He went into the Gourmet World and 
was lucky to make it back out alive.

00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:47.810
The Four Kings are a 
pretty interesting bunch.

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:52.120
Well, I can think of one who's a 
lot more trouble than the others...

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:56.620
We'll have to take measures before 
going to the Gourmet World, won't we?

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:57.620
Oh, yeah.

00:12:57.990 --> 00:13:00.260
Then shall we go?

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:02.790
What to do?!

00:13:03.560 --> 00:13:05.900
Pipe down! That's too excited!

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:07.930
Well, after all... After 
all... After all...

00:13:07.930 --> 00:13:10.470
I get to meet the world's 
greatest cutler!

00:13:10.470 --> 00:13:14.770
To us chefs, he's the most charismatic 
of all the charismatic people out there!

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:19.310
I wonder what kind of fine techniques 
I'll be able to see! I can't wait!

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:23.480
It'll be my first time meeting him too, 
but I hear he's quite a dynamic guy.

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:29.390
In order to test the sharpness 
of the knives he makes,

00:13:29.390 --> 00:13:32.020
Melk slices apart huge beasts.

00:13:32.760 --> 00:13:37.960
He also traverses extremely dangerous 
areas to mine natural whetstones.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:42.100
And his body is covered with scars 
from cuts by his own knives...

00:13:43.500 --> 00:13:45.400
Those are the rumors, anyway.

00:13:45.700 --> 00:13:47.770
Those were rumors?!

00:13:47.770 --> 00:13:53.040
Melk knives are famous, but the man 
himself never appears in public,

00:13:53.040 --> 00:13:56.380
so the various rumors about him 
have taken on a life of their own.

00:13:56.380 --> 00:14:00.020
So he's a charismatic cutler 
that nobody knows, huh?

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:02.720
Most of the jobs he takes 
on are arranged by mail,

00:14:02.720 --> 00:14:04.560
and some say he hates people altogether.

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:09.890
That could be the reason he lives in 
this isolated area deep in the mountains.

00:14:10.090 --> 00:14:15.670
I-I bet he's the epitome of a proud 
craftsman, devoted to his work.

00:14:15.670 --> 00:14:20.870
Anyhow, we won't get anywhere until 
we meet this Melk face to face.

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:25.810
That goes for Melk Stardust and getting 
him to make you a new knife...

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:30.010
But to do that, we have 
to climb this first.

00:14:32.450 --> 00:14:36.120
What is this huge staircase?!

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:38.290
This is Melk Mountain.

00:14:38.290 --> 00:14:41.860
It's said that Melk himself 
carved out the stairs,

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:43.530
which is why the mountain's 
named after him.

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:45.660
How high is this mountain?!

00:14:45.660 --> 00:14:47.600
I can't even see the peak!

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:50.570
Most importantly, how 
many steps are there?!

00:14:50.570 --> 00:14:52.670
The elevation is 4,000 meters,

00:14:52.670 --> 00:14:55.370
so I guess there are about 
20,000 steps to the top.

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.870
20,000 steps?!

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.580
I've never climbed any kind 
of staircase like that!

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:02.150
It should be a cinch compared 
to Vegetable Sky, right?

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:03.450
Okay, let's go!

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:08.250
Heave...

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:09.190
...ho!

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:14.130
Toriko-san! Let's take a little break!

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:17.900
Hey! We haven't even been 
climbing for an hour!

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:22.500
Don't you think each step of 
this staircase is too huge?!

00:15:23.470 --> 00:15:26.800
Maybe the size is perfect for Melk!

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:29.640
He's probably like a giant, huh?

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:35.450
I've never seen a human this size, 
other than Knocking Master Jiro!

00:15:35.750 --> 00:15:37.520
Anyway, let's go, Komatsu!

00:15:37.520 --> 00:15:39.250
We've still got a long way ahead of us!

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:40.850
R-Right!

00:15:44.420 --> 00:15:47.090
Toriko-san!

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:49.990
Please wait for me!

00:15:49.990 --> 00:15:54.430
Yeesh! Hurry up! The 
sun's gonna go down!

00:15:56.170 --> 00:16:00.040
We've been climbing all this time and 
I still see no trace of the summit...

00:16:00.040 --> 00:16:03.340
It looks like we haven't even 
hit the halfway point...

00:16:03.340 --> 00:16:05.810
What's with this staircase?

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:08.610
Can the person who created 
such fine, beautiful knives

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:12.020
really be a giant big 
enough for these steps?

00:16:12.620 --> 00:16:14.150
No, that can't be it!

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:17.460
Melk-san purposely made the 
stairs inaccessible like this

00:16:17.460 --> 00:16:20.090
so he could concentrate 
on his work in peace!

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:23.330
Then why don't we just fly 
to the top by plane...?

00:16:27.300 --> 00:16:33.240
I-I see... It's the usual pattern with 
the sky, so it's not safe for planes...

00:16:34.010 --> 00:16:37.610
Oh, well. Why don't we camp 
out here 'til morning?

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:44.680
A lot of the rocks strewn 
around here contain sulfur,

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:46.350
perfect for making a fire.

00:16:46.350 --> 00:16:47.850
Toriko-san...

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:51.590
Do you really think Melk-san 
will make me a new knife?

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:54.730
Well, you won't know 'til you ask him.

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:59.530
A lot of craftsmen are 
ill-tempered to begin with...

00:16:59.530 --> 00:17:03.100
What'll I do if I suddenly intrude 
on him and make him mad at me?

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:07.610
If you offend him, just pray he doesn't 
test out one of his Melk knives on you.

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:10.170
Please don't say scary things like that!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:13.440
Tomorrow, when we reach Melk's 
workshop at the summit,

00:17:13.440 --> 00:17:15.980
we'll find out if he'll 
make the knife for you

00:17:15.980 --> 00:17:20.820
and whether or not he has any 
information on Melk Stardust.

00:17:20.820 --> 00:17:22.650
Yeah, that's true.

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:27.290
And at worst, you can always buy a new 
knife at a gourmet department store.

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:36.400
Furnips, huh?

00:17:34.730 --> 00:17:38.470
Furnip (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 15

00:17:36.400 --> 00:17:38.470
They're cousins of monkeys 
that live in mines.

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:41.840
That must mean there's a grindstone 
extraction site in this area!

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:43.880
Melk's workshop is nearby!

00:17:47.050 --> 00:17:48.780
Th-These are...

00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:54.590
Komatsu, are you okay?!

00:17:55.750 --> 00:17:58.520
My death may be closer 
than the workshop!

00:17:58.520 --> 00:18:00.590
Can't you do something?!

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:03.030
The thing is, these guys 
aren't tasty at all!

00:18:03.030 --> 00:18:07.330
In other words, you don't wanna fight 
unless it involves eating afterward, huh?

00:18:07.330 --> 00:18:09.270
Yep! That's it exactly!

00:18:11.940 --> 00:18:13.470
More things from above!

00:18:13.370 --> 00:18:15.340
Rock Wolves (Mammalian 
Beast) Capture Level 18

00:18:13.670 --> 00:18:15.410
These are Rock Wolves!

00:18:16.110 --> 00:18:18.380
We're caught in the middle!

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:26.720
Hey, Komatsu!

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:29.820
There it is! The top!

00:18:29.820 --> 00:18:30.760
Oh!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:33.420
What the...?!

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:34.990
Is something wrong?

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:37.500
They've suddenly stopped chasing us.

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:41.470
It's true...

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:42.570
I get it.

00:18:42.570 --> 00:18:45.840
They don't want to get near 
the summit, where Melk is.

00:18:45.840 --> 00:18:48.840
Even though their capture levels 
are nothing to sneeze at...

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:52.080
What kind of man is Melk?

00:18:52.080 --> 00:18:53.040
Toriko-san!

00:18:53.580 --> 00:18:55.180
Let's hurry up!

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:56.210
Right!

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:10.160
Th-This is Melk-san's workshop!

00:19:10.160 --> 00:19:13.560
Huh... There isn't a sign or anything.

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:18.070
Wha...?!

00:19:18.370 --> 00:19:22.270
What is this sharp fighting spirit?!

00:19:22.270 --> 00:19:24.680
He's the world's most famous cutler,

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:27.610
so there's no need to 
put out a sign, right?

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:30.050
Is Melk working right now?

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:32.420
But that fighting spirit I felt...

00:19:33.250 --> 00:19:35.690
If it was aimed at us...

00:19:36.850 --> 00:19:38.060
Komatsu!

00:19:41.230 --> 00:19:45.360
Scale Kong (Mammalian Beast) Capture Level 22

00:19:42.630 --> 00:19:44.700
That's a Scale Kong!

00:19:45.400 --> 00:19:48.930
Could a creature with its 
level have climbed up?

00:19:58.440 --> 00:19:59.580
That fighting spirit from before!

00:19:59.580 --> 00:20:00.910
Scale Shave!

00:20:04.550 --> 00:20:05.980
Wh-What the...?!

00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.590
I've still got a ways to go.

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:20.100
It looks like there are 
a few scales left...

00:20:20.770 --> 00:20:24.600
I guess it's around 30% of perfection...

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:27.440
D-Did you just do that?

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.470
Yeah, that's right.

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:34.850
I see. So the fighting spirit that was 
as sharp as a knife belonged to you, eh?

00:20:35.280 --> 00:20:40.590
Then you were on guard against 
that Scale Kong from the start.

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:44.290
That technique you used to remove 
all those giant scales at once...

00:20:44.290 --> 00:20:46.290
You've got quite the way with knives.

00:20:46.290 --> 00:20:49.230
So who are you? A disciple of Melk's?

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:51.030
Disciple?

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:57.340
I <i>am</i> Melk! Cutler Melk!

00:20:58.440 --> 00:20:59.840
What?!

00:22:05.670 --> 00:22:06.840
Dishing with Tina!

00:22:07.340 --> 00:22:10.010
Starting today, we've got a heaping 
helping of a new talk show,

00:22:10.010 --> 00:22:11.310
Dishing with Tina!

00:22:11.310 --> 00:22:16.180
Our first guest is IGO's 
wild beast trainer, Rin-san!

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:17.680
Nice to meet you!

00:22:17.680 --> 00:22:18.950
Is everyone watching?!

00:22:18.950 --> 00:22:22.220
By the way, what kind of work 
does a Beast Trainer do?

00:22:22.220 --> 00:22:26.390
Let's see... At the Gourmet research 
facility, I calm down Beasts,

00:22:26.390 --> 00:22:29.060
cheer them up, once in 
a while meet Toriko...

00:22:29.060 --> 00:22:34.600
O-Okay... Um... What was your 
happiest experience at work?

00:22:34.600 --> 00:22:37.570
That would have to be... meeting Toriko!

00:22:37.570 --> 00:22:38.670
And finally...!

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:41.240
The Acrostic Corner!

00:22:41.240 --> 00:22:44.810
Okay, please make the theme be "Toriko"!

00:22:42.710 --> 00:22:47.880
TO RI KO

00:22:44.810 --> 00:22:46.210
When did you...

00:22:46.210 --> 00:22:48.210
All right, please go ahead.

00:22:47.880 --> 00:22:50.950
TO

00:22:48.210 --> 00:22:50.450
TOtally beautiful Toriko!

00:22:50.950 --> 00:22:54.520
RI

00:22:51.450 --> 00:22:54.020
RIn really wants to see Toriko!

00:22:54.520 --> 00:22:56.220
KO

00:22:55.020 --> 00:22:59.460
KOme here right now! 
Toriko! Where are you?!

00:22:59.460 --> 00:23:02.490
All she did was talk about Toriko!

00:23:02.490 --> 00:23:04.860
Okay. On to the next segment...

00:23:07.090 --> 00:23:09.460
Melk's more handsome than I imagined!

00:23:09.460 --> 00:23:11.950
Oh, it's an extra portion of lovely new gentleman...

00:23:11.950 --> 00:23:14.470
...Wait, why are you fighting!?

00:23:14.660 --> 00:23:17.510
Tension! Toriko's Knife Versus Melk's Knife!

00:23:17.510 --> 00:23:19.510
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
